<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Finance companies started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Finance companies started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JWCharles/CSG has started coverage of Green Tree Financial Corp and Washington Federal Savings &amp; Loan Association with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- In a May 1 report, analysts Allan Roness and William Trent set a 12-month price target for Green Tree of $42.</p>
<p>-- In an April 30 report, analyst Deborah Beylus set a 12-month price target for Washington Federal of $30.</p>
<p>-- Green Tree closed Thursday at 30-3/8. Those of Washington Federal closed at 23-13/16.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
